# H1 run dirs — commit the small decisive artifacts, keep the heavy local.
# RUN-PROTOCOL §6: commit manifest/metrics/checks/audit/cost/report/per_dialogue;
# keep raw/, cards.jsonl, chunks and packet stores local unless a reviewer asks
# (their sha256 is in the manifest either way).
#
# DELIVERABLE-PACKAGE §4 overrides for the REFERENCE run only: it is committed
# in full INCLUDING raw/ (the replay fuel). When the reference run lands,
# add an exception for runs/<reference_run_id>/raw/ in this file.
#
# Patterns are relative to this file's directory (runs/).
#
# NOTE (strip 2026-08-28): the artifact lines below carry the required '!'
# un-ignore prefix. The version that landed on h1/eval-specialist/d1 omitted
# them, which made checks.json/controls.json/manifest.json etc. un-committable
# (silently dropped by git add) — contradicting RUN-PROTOCOL §6 and the
# strip plan §5 (additive checks.json/controls.json must survive).

*/*
!*/
!*/manifest.json
!*/metrics.json
!*/metrics_b0.json
!*/metrics_b1.json
!*/metrics_b2.json
!*/metrics_B0.json
!*/metrics_B1.json
!*/metrics_B2.json
!*/checks.json
!*/audit.json
!*/cost.json
!*/report.md
!*/per_dialogue.jsonl
!*/controls.json
!*/replay_result.json
*/raw/
*/data/
*/packets/
*/fixtures_work/
*/replay_verify/
*/control_nc1/
*/control_nc2/
*/control_nc3_ts/
*/eval_B0/
*/eval_B1/
*/eval_B2/
*/eval_T/
